60
00:37:06,312 --> 00:37:09,832
こんがらたってもしょうがないから 修理は後日
It's no use getting all tangled up, so repairs can wait.

61
00:37:15,192 --> 00:37:18,972
今夜にあたしの愛なら 真夜中にだってものかちでしょう
Tonight, if it's my love, we'll surely win even in the middle of the night!

62
00:37:51,612 --> 00:37:58,292
遠くて近くて傍にいるのに 僕はどれくらい知れているんだろう
Even though you're far yet near and by my side, how much do I really know?

63
00:37:59,252 --> 00:38:06,032
見下ろす空見つめる時に 焦がれてるすまの中で揺れてる 消えないでよ
When looking down at the sky, trembling within the yearning... don't fade away!

64
00:38:06,192 --> 00:38:15,152
溺れる度輝いて 運命なのか魔物なのか 旋律が心に咲く
Shining every time I drown, whether fate or a demon, melody blooms in my heart.

65
00:38:23,972 --> 00:38:27,872
すべての揺らぎを脱ぎ捨てたい
I want to cast off all hesitations,

66
00:38:27,872 --> 00:38:32,192
自由をあなたと抱き締めたい
and embrace freedom tightly with you.

67
00:38:32,512 --> 00:38:37,472
同じ夢の中目覚めたのなら 瞬く不安も眠むらに
If we woke up inside the same dream, even twinkling anxiety would fall asleep.

68
00:38:38,272 --> 00:38:45,792
ここには僕らし かいられない 覗いた窓の外にはとまり
Only we can be here, stopping outside the window we peeked through.

69
00:38:45,992 --> 00:38:53,652
決めて少し静かに 響き渡っていく あなたの足元へと帰りたい
Deciding a little quietly, echoing far, I want to return to your feet.

70
00:39:01,792 --> 00:39:07,792
この声届いてる？ 心はここにある
Can this voice reach you? My heart is right here.

71
00:39:08,612 --> 00:39:14,272
寂びの君のサイド 20メートルコバ
By your side in the loneliness, twenty meters away,

72
00:39:14,272 --> 00:39:17,432
いつまでそこにいれるんだろ
how long can I stay there?

73
00:39:32,012 --> 00:39:37,872
祈る度包まれて 愛せないのか孤独なのか
Wrapped every time I pray, unable to love or in solitude?

74
00:39:40,912 --> 00:39:50,412
旋律が心に咲く 誰にも言えずにみつめるだけ
Melody blooms in my heart, just gazing without telling anyone...

75
00:39:51,152 --> 00:39:55,412
すべての揺らぎを脱ぎ捨てたい
I want to cast off all hesitations,

76
00:39:55,412 --> 00:39:59,812
自由をあなたと抱き締めたい
and embrace freedom tightly with you.

77
00:40:03,674 --> 00:40:09,074
出会いも別れも繰り返して ここには僕らしさが見られない
Having experienced so many meetings and partings, I can't find my true self in this place.

78
00:40:10,034 --> 00:40:14,014
望んだ窓の外にはトバり
Outside the window I wished for lies a veil of night.

79
00:40:14,374 --> 00:40:20,774
決めた孤独すこしずつに響き渡って あなたの足跡へと帰っていきたい
Resonating little by little with the chosen solitude, I want to return to your footsteps.

80
00:40:45,214 --> 00:40:49,174
止まった止まった聞かせてください
Please stop, stop, and let me hear it.

81
00:40:53,094 --> 00:41:00,454
消え去った街ように見かされてずっと縛り付けられている この上
Being stared at like a vanished town, I've been bound here all this time, up above this place...

82
00:41:03,214 --> 00:41:10,674
誰かがしたって焦った街のベッドを漂っていく
Drifting through the bed of a town where someone hurried and panicked.

83
00:41:11,534 --> 00:41:20,774
きっと誰もただ一人で口を突く見ながら泣きながら鳴いてるんだ
Surely everyone is crying and weeping all alone, muttering to themselves.

84
00:41:21,494 --> 00:41:29,134
ねえ今夜愛してる大嫌い大好きたぶん想うくらいの想いが溢れる
Hey, tonight, I love you, I hate you, I adore you—probably enough feelings to overwhelm my thoughts.

85
00:41:30,674 --> 00:41:35,674
強制して去っていくこの感情は
This emotion that forces its way out and leaves...

86
00:41:35,994 --> 00:41:45,374
音の中で初めて光り合うんだね 歌の中で初めて響き鳴すんだ
We finally shine together within the sound, and resonate for the first time within a song.

87
00:41:49,594 --> 00:41:57,774
責めぎったダイヤモンド 並んだ表情に臆病になっていたこの上
Pushing and pulling diamonds, becoming cowardly before the lined-up expressions, up above this place...

88
00:41:58,594 --> 00:42:08,374
叶わない暴力と血潮まれの重力に名前も居場所も埋め付けられている
My name and place are buried under unrelenting violence and blood-soaked gravity.

89
00:42:09,214 --> 00:42:14,874
なんてどこかで吐きたい言い訳が声を奪ったまま
Excuses I wanted to vent somewhere end up robbing me of my voice...

90
00:42:15,594 --> 00:42:19,534
遠いみたいになってるんだ今さら
It feels so far away now, after all this time.

91
00:42:20,674 --> 00:42:27,734
笑えない風体を信じてそっと月夜になるくらいの想いがうずまく
Believing in a countenance that cannot smile, feelings as deep as a moonlit night swirl softly within.

92
00:42:29,814 --> 00:42:36,534
今日も街は去っていく猛り足が飛び上がる準備をしている
Today too, the town moves on, and ferocious feet prepare to leap into the air.

93
00:42:41,074 --> 00:42:48,574
何もかも半端で起こして沈んでいく
Leaving everything half-done, waking up and sinking down.

94
00:42:59,534 --> 00:43:04,534
頭まっかっか
My head is burning red.

95
00:43:10,374 --> 00:43:15,214
信じたい信じたいそうだよそうだよ
I want to believe, I want to believe—that's right, that's right.

96
00:43:15,334 --> 00:43:21,674
嫌いじゃない好きじゃない全部が一つになりたい離れたい
I don't hate it, I don't love it; I want everything to become one, yet I want to pull away.

97
00:43:22,154 --> 00:43:28,814
どうしたいどうしての聞かされない聞かせて
What do I want? Why is that? I can't hear it—let me hear it.

98
00:43:29,974 --> 00:43:35,674
伝えたい愛してる大嫌い大好き
I want to convey it: I love you, I hate you, I adore you—

99
00:43:36,154 --> 00:43:43,374
たぶん想うくらいの想いのサイズまで今日もまた大好きなこの感情が
Until it reaches the size of feelings I can barely hold, today once again, this beloved emotion...

100
00:43:44,174 --> 00:43:52,374
音の中で初めて光り合うまで あなたのその骨で響き出すまで
...shines together within the sound for the very first time, echoing right down to your bones.

101
00:44:01,934 --> 00:44:11,774
愛してる大嫌い大好き嘘だよ大好き
I love you, I hate you, I adore you—just kidding, I love you so much!

102
00:44:40,074 --> 00:44:43,354
蹴りな！
Kick it!

103
00:44:43,694 --> 00:44:47,054
盛り上がってますね！
You guys are getting so hyped!

104
00:44:47,594 --> 00:44:53,214
ということで星街すいせいライブ『SuperNova: REBOOT』、いよいよ始まりましたー！
With that, Hoshimachi Suisei Live "SuperNova: REBOOT" has officially begun!

105
